<title>USA: PDL hepatitis B antibody in phase 2 trials.</title>
<headline>PDL hepatitis B antibody in phase 2 trials.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Protein Design Labs Inc said its collaborative partner, Boehringer Mannheim GmbH, has started a multinational Phase II clinical trial of PDL's hepatitis B antibody.</p>
<p>Under the study, 200 patients from the U.S., Israel and several European countries, will be evaluated over a 24-week treatment period. It will evaluate the Protein Design antibody as a single therapy and in combination with interferon-alpha, the only approved treatment for the disease.</p>
</text>
